  "faqBookingRecurringQ": "Can I book a recurring service?",
  "faqBookingRecurringA": "Yes. You can book a recurring service by choosing your preferred frequency while confirming the slot. We support weekly and bi-weekly repeats in most cities.",
  "faqBookingEquipmentQ": "Do I need to provide all the cleaning equipment?",
  "faqBookingEquipmentA": "Basic supplies should be available at your location. For selected premium plans, partners may carry service essentials as listed on the service detail page.",
  "faqBookingRescheduleQ": "How do I reschedule or cancel a booking?",
  "faqBookingRescheduleA": "Open My Bookings, choose the booking, and select reschedule or cancel. Cancellation fees depend on how close you are to the service time.",
  "faqBookingIssueQ": "What if there is a service issue?",
  "faqBookingIssueA": "Raise a support request from this page with booking details. Our team reviews quality issues and helps with resolution or compensation where applicable.",
  "faqBookingPriceQ": "How is service price calculated?",
  "faqBookingPriceA": "Price is based on service type, duration, location, and add-ons. You always see the final amount before payment confirmation.",
  "faqAccountUpdateAddressQ": "How do I update a saved address?",
  "faqAccountUpdateAddressA": "Go to Profile > Saved addresses. Select the address card and update the details, then save.",
  "faqAccountAddAddressQ": "How do I add a new address?",
  "faqAccountAddAddressA": "From Saved addresses, tap Add addresses and enter your complete address with landmark and pin code.",
  "faqAccountContactQ": "How do I contact support?",
  "faqAccountContactA": "Use the Call us button on the Help & support page. You can also open a category here and tap the support card at the bottom.",
  "faqPaymentsFailedQ": "My payment failed but the money left my account",
  "faqPaymentsFailedA": "If payment is pending, it usually auto-reverses within bank timelines. If not reversed, share payment ID with support and we will help track it.",
  "faqPaymentsCouponQ": "How do I use a coupon or offer?",
  "faqPaymentsCouponA": "Apply coupon codes during checkout on the payment screen. Valid offers are reflected instantly before you place the booking.",
  "faqPaymentsRefundQ": "Will I get a refund if I cancel?",
  "faqPaymentsRefundA": "Refund eligibility depends on cancellation timing and service terms. The exact policy is shown before you confirm cancellation.",
  "faqQualityDamageQ": "Is there a damage policy for service?",
  "faqQualityDamageA": "Yes. Report damage within 24 hours with photos and booking details. Claims are reviewed as per policy and partner verification.",
  "faqQualityRateQ": "How do I rate my partner?",
  "faqQualityRateA": "After service completion, open the booking and submit a rating with comments. Your feedback helps us maintain quality standards.",
  "faqSafetyTrustQ": "How can I trust your service?",
  "faqSafetyTrustA": "TaskTeddy verifies partners, tracks bookings, and monitors quality reports. We also offer in-app support for issue escalation.",
  "faqSafetyVerifiedQ": "Are TaskTeddy partners verified?",
  "faqSafetyVerifiedA": "Yes, we run onboarding checks including identity verification and basic service screening before activation.",
  "faqSafetyShareQ": "What does TaskTeddy share with partners about me?",
  "faqSafetyShareA": "Partners see only the details needed for service fulfillment, such as name, location, slot, and service notes.",
  "faqSafetyUnsafeQ": "I feel unsafe during a booking - what do I do?",
  "faqSafetyUnsafeA": "End the interaction immediately, move to a safe space, and call support from this page. In emergencies, contact local authorities first.",
